- doh behaviors observed: main sources → `ubuntu.sources` (deb822, noble);
  every third-party `.list` renamed to `.list.distUpgrade` (disabled); a
  noble `.sources` twin generated for PPAs. Conffile prompt kept noble's
  version for a few files → functional losses (audited, restore in Phase 4):
